(Phnom Penh): On the morning of July 20, 2020, at the National Defense University, a ceremony was held to receive a Commander-in-Chief's car as a precious gift from Lt. Gen. Dr. HUN Manet, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Commander-in-Chief of the Army.
In fact, in the border event in the area of Preah Vihear temple in 2008, the national defense was strengthened, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit provided the construction of infrastructure, bridges, roads, provided the army with all capabilities, combat capability, built schools, hospitals, built wells. Water builds thousands of army families' homes, forms army development villages along the border, provides rice, provides means for military families to grow crops.
Every season of climate change, every year, the two princes provide the rainy season, the princes provide the winter raincoats, the princes provide the winter coats for the army. This factor has made the army warmer, more stable, expanded the will to fight, dare to sacrifice everything.
