According to the spokesperson of the General Commissioner, within 80 days of tightening the road traffic law by increasing the fine according to Sub-Decree No. 39, from May 1 to July 19, 2020, the traffic police nationwide inspected And fined a total of 110,618 vehicles, including 81633 motorcycles and 28985 vehicles of all types.
Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun said that for the past 80 days, the implementation of the new sub-decree to fine vehicles for offenses has been going well. He thanked and commended all the road users for their good obedience to the traffic law so far, especially the traffic police for their dedication and hard work. Tighten traffic with the highest sense of responsibility.
