Four questions with Ms. O Vandin about a Cambodian-American woman who ran away from Chattalysak (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): A Cambodian-American woman named Ros Vira, 37 years old, escaped from a Chattalysak in a hotel in Phnom Penh brings a lot of surprises. However, authorities and medical teams tried to find the woman on the night of July 18 while hiding in Kampong Cham.
