(Kampong Thom): Mr. Rim Soklong, a clerk in Kampong Thom province, died suddenly and tragically in the canal while driving a Camry car on a red paved road and fell into the canal.
According to the police, this horrific traffic accident happened on July 17, 2020 at 19:20 on the red gravel road at the point of the canal, Veang Khang Cheung village, Tang Krasaing commune, Santuk district, Kampong Thom province.
The victim was a 34-year-old man named Rim Soklong, of Cam Bak Village, Sangkat Damrey Choan Khla, Stung Sen City, Kampong Thom Province. The car crashed into the road and died at the scene.
The bodies of the victims are now being taken by relatives for a traditional ceremony at their homes.
